{"id": "86261", "name": "שברים חלקיים – x·(x+c)·(x+d) במכנה (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Give the expression</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>as a sum of partial fractions.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:Sanswer]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:Sanswer]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Three different linear factors: one term for each; multiply by the denominator and substitute the three roots.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The form</b><br>The rules for partial fractions are summarized below.<div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\"><b>Rules of partial fractions.</b> If the degree of the numerator is at least the degree of the denominator, divide first. Then each factor of the denominator gives terms:<ul style=\"margin:6px 0\"><li>a linear factor \\(ax+b\\): \\(\\dfrac{A}{ax+b}\\);</li><li>a repeated linear factor \\((ax+b)^2\\): \\(\\dfrac{A}{ax+b}+\\dfrac{B}{(ax+b)^2}\\);</li><li>an irreducible quadratic factor \\(ax^2+bx+c\\): \\(\\dfrac{Ax+B}{ax^2+bx+c}\\).</li></ul></div>Applying these rules, we find that<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = \\frac{A}{x} + \\frac{B}{{CT:1}} + \\frac{C}{{CT:2}}, \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Finding the constants</b><br>and multiplying through by the denominator {{CT:3}} we see that<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} = {{CT:5}} + {{CT:6}} + {{CT:7}}. \\]</p>Setting \\(x = 0\\) we see that \\(A = {{CT:8}}\\), setting \\(x= {{CT:9}}\\) we see that \\(B = {{CT:10}}\\) and setting \\(x = {{CT:11}}\\) we see that \\(C = {{CT:12}}\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — The answer</b><br>Therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:13}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "Sanswer", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "PartFrac", "sans": "Sanswer", "tans": "answer", "testoptions": "x", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-SPF-TRUE ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-SPF-FALSE ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Aval", "Bval", "Bxden2", "Cval", "Cxden1", "a", "answer", "b", "c", "cd", "d", "den", "den1", "den2", "f", "mag_b", "mag_c", "mag_d", "mc", "md", "numerat", "sign_b", "sign_c", "term1"], "nvariants": 50}